  message: "Fixed in PR #2198 with INV-dulah's BitBake limb. Re-ran the repro: DEPENDS = \"a\" then DEPENDS += \"b\" now gives two Symbols with two ids (the id carries the declaration's own lines). Fixture plus fluent-bit's two recipes: ids shared by two nodes 4 -> 0; contains edges 23 -> 30; no stable id gone. No Yocto layer is cloned on this machine."  # 9922
